    "description": "Developed an Interactive Voice Recognition application for collections and payments over the phone using Microsoft .NET Web Services and Aspect Zipwire contact center.\n\nDeveloped and kept up-to-date public and private payment websites for the firm’s collections using ASP.NET, C#, USAePay’s API for Electronic Checks and Credit Cards transactions, Worldpay’s API for International Credit Cards transactions and Microsoft SQL Server as the backend database.\n\nDeveloped an Interactive Voice Recognition application for payment transactions over the phone using Microsoft .NET XML Web Services and Genesys Cloud Contact Center.\n\nDeveloped multiple stand-alone Windows and Console applications, Libraries and Web Services using Visual Studio (2005 - 2013), iTextSharp, SecureBlackbox OpenPGP, ASP.NET, C# and Microsoft .NET Frameworks (2.0 - 4.5). Most for tasks automation and electronic communications.\n\nHelped in the development of an in-house Case Management System using Visual Basic .NET, Windows Forms and Infragistics Netadvantage for .NET components.\n\nImplemented and managed Crystal Reports, Crystal Reports Server and Microsoft SQL Server Databases for in-house and client reporting needs.\n\nShared the role of Web Administrator implementing and managing secured Web and FTP sites using Microsoft IIS and Verisign certificates.",
